  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to build a long-term strategic partnership with South Africa exploiting the societal impact of research infrastructures and building capacity to support and develop them. Programme will support pump-priming activities in new areas as well as support existing, successful, strategic programmes such as Development in Africa with Radio Astronomy.</narrative>
